WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.300
-Today is Friday,
and that's usually when I

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.567
catch up with some
personal stuff.

00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:05.501
You know, I check my inbox,
I return emails and,

00:00:05.501 --> 00:00:07.434
of course, I send out
thank you notes.

00:00:07.434 --> 00:00:08.968
And I was --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.968 --> 00:00:10.434
Thank you.
I love you guys.

00:00:10.434 --> 00:00:12.033
I was running a bit behind
today, so I thought

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:13.567
if you guys wouldn't mind,
I'd just like to write out

00:00:13.567 --> 00:00:15.267
my weekly thank you notes
right now.

00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:16.567
I appreciate it.

00:00:16.567 --> 00:00:18.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:18.033 --> 00:00:19.734
The best audience
in the business.

00:00:19.734 --> 00:00:21.934
James, can I get some thank you
note writing music, please?

00:00:21.934 --> 00:00:23.501
♪♪

00:00:23.501 --> 00:00:25.133
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.133 --> 00:00:26.634
He's like a "Mona Lisa."

00:00:26.634 --> 00:00:29.901
I don't know
if he's happy or upset.

00:00:29.901 --> 00:00:32.300
-Mystic, mystic smile.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:33.667
-Mmm.

00:00:36.801 --> 00:00:39.934
-Thank you, "Eternals,"
or as I like to call you,

00:00:39.934 --> 00:00:41.734
designer Power Rangers.

00:00:41.734 --> 00:00:43.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:47.434 --> 00:00:51.167
Thank you, Jack-O-Lantern
for always being way scarier

00:00:51.167 --> 00:00:54.734
the first week of November
than you ever were on Halloween.

00:00:54.734 --> 00:00:56.701
What the heck is that thing?
Get it off!

00:00:56.701 --> 00:00:58.834
Get it!
You take it off the porch!

00:00:58.834 --> 00:01:00.734
I don't want to touch it."

00:01:00.734 --> 00:01:02.501
-Get a dust pan.

00:01:02.501 --> 00:01:04.367
-Get a shovel.
Something, man.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.934
Thank you, McDonald's,
selling an McRib NFT

00:01:10.934 --> 00:01:13.367
for combining a mysterious
object no one understands

00:01:13.367 --> 00:01:15.901
with a mysterious object
no one understands.

00:01:15.901 --> 00:01:17.300
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:18.534
So meta.

00:01:24.701 --> 00:01:28.133
Thank you, Adele's new song
"I Drink Wine..."

00:01:28.133 --> 00:01:30.701
[ Cheering ]

00:01:30.701 --> 00:01:32.300
...for finally giving
millennials there very own

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:33.767
"Margaritaville."

00:01:33.767 --> 00:01:35.634
It's our anthem!
Come on!

00:01:35.634 --> 00:01:37.234
It's our anthem!

00:01:37.234 --> 00:01:40.267
[ Applause ]

00:01:40.267 --> 00:01:43.200
Thank you, staple removers,
for looking like

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:45.334
the rattlesnakes
of Office Depot.

00:01:45.334 --> 00:01:48.300
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:52.801 --> 00:01:56.100
Thank you, leaf peeping,
for basically being

00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:58.834
bird watching for people who are
terrible at finding birds.

00:01:58.834 --> 00:02:00.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:04.334
Leaf peeper.

00:02:04.334 --> 00:02:06.267
Sure, if it makes you happy.
Come on.

00:02:09.267 --> 00:02:14.334
Thank you, microwave
add 30 seconds button,

00:02:14.334 --> 00:02:15.801
for rendering
every other button

00:02:15.801 --> 00:02:19.501
on my microwave completely
and totally obsolete.

00:02:19.501 --> 00:02:21.734
Pop, pop, pop, pop, pop popcorn!

00:02:21.734 --> 00:02:23.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:23.334 --> 00:02:25.734
-30 minutes?

00:02:25.734 --> 00:02:29.334
-Pop, pop, pop, pop, popcorn!

00:02:29.334 --> 00:02:30.934
-Pow, pow.

00:02:30.934 --> 00:02:32.300
-That's what I'm like
when I go gambling.

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:33.634
-Yeah.
-Jimmy Popcorn here.

00:02:33.634 --> 00:02:34.868
-Every time you're at the craps
table you just yell,

00:02:34.868 --> 00:02:36.734
"Popcorn!"
-Yeah I go...

00:02:36.734 --> 00:02:38.567
[ Rattling ]

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:43.000
Popcorn!

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:44.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:44.734 --> 00:02:46.167
That's it. Worth it.

00:02:46.167 --> 00:02:47.367
No, no.

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:50.334
Popcorn! Yeah, yeah.

00:02:50.334 --> 00:02:52.634
I gotta remember that.
I love Vegas.

00:02:52.634 --> 00:02:54.234
I'll go there next time
and I'll do, "Popcorn."

00:02:54.234 --> 00:02:57.200
-What's that?
-I'm going to Vegas --

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:58.567
-Yeah, let me know when you go.
I wanna go.

00:02:58.567 --> 00:02:59.968
-What's that?
-Let me know when you go.

00:02:59.968 --> 00:03:02.200
-Okay.
-Not before.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:04.300
-Not before.
-Wait until you go,

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:05.400
then tell me after,
we'll talk about it.

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:06.868
-So when I'm there
I should tell you.

00:03:06.868 --> 00:03:08.467
-Mnh-mnh.
When you come back home.

00:03:08.467 --> 00:03:10.434
-Okay.
-I'll wait for it.

00:03:10.434 --> 00:03:12.400
-Yeah, I'll wait, don't worry.
It's gonna be great.

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:14.534
-I can't wait.
-For me to go to Vegas?

00:03:14.534 --> 00:03:16.400
[ Laughter ]

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:19.033
-I can't even talk about it now.

00:03:19.033 --> 00:03:20.434
-Why?
You got something to do?

00:03:20.434 --> 00:03:22.667
-Yeah.

00:03:22.667 --> 00:03:23.968
-What's that?
-What's that?

00:03:23.968 --> 00:03:25.300
[ Laughter ]

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:26.467
I'm going to do this bit.
I'm going to finish this bit.

00:03:26.467 --> 00:03:27.367
-Oh, I'm sorry.
You were doing a bit.

00:03:27.367 --> 00:03:28.901
I did not realize it.

00:03:28.901 --> 00:03:30.801
Zip, zip,
shutting it up.

00:03:30.801 --> 00:03:32.868
Go for it.
Don't want to interrupt it.

00:03:32.868 --> 00:03:34.701
-No.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:34.701 --> 00:03:36.901
It's humor. The people --
the people enjoy it.

00:03:36.901 --> 00:03:38.300
Got to show some respect.

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:39.634
-You gotta respect comedy.

00:03:39.634 --> 00:03:41.167
-You've got to show it
the respect.

00:03:41.167 --> 00:03:43.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:48.734 --> 00:03:52.334
-Thank you, getting into a car
while holding a pizza box,

00:03:52.334 --> 00:03:53.534
for making me feel like
I'm playing

00:03:53.534 --> 00:03:55.167
a game of human "Tetris."

00:03:55.167 --> 00:03:57.868
[ Applause ]

00:03:57.868 --> 00:04:00.701
-Popcorn!
-Oh!

00:04:00.701 --> 00:04:02.234
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:02.234 --> 00:04:04.000
Wait, this is the last one?
-Yes.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:07.067
[ Laughter ]

00:04:07.067 --> 00:04:09.367
Thank you,
two-door refrigerators,

00:04:09.367 --> 00:04:12.200
for making it look like my
condiments are flashing me.

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:13.834
There you have it, everybody.
Those are my "Thank You Notes."

